    tourCrewAssignTitle: "The core task: assignments",
    tourCrewAssignBody: "Games for the selected slot wait on the left; rooms and tables are on the right. Once you select a game, markers show which rooms and tables are a good fit for its seats and requirements. Drag it onto a table or use selection mode.",
    tourCrewSlotsTitle: "Choose the slot first",
    tourCrewSlotsBody: "The slot bar limits assignments to a time period. Scroll horizontally when there are many slots; assignment mode and details sit beside it.",
    tourCrewAutoTitle: "Auto-assign and clear slot",
    tourCrewAutoBody: "Auto-assign first creates a reviewable preview and only saves after confirmation. “Clear slot” removes every table assignment in the selected slot after a warning; the games themselves remain.",
    tourCrewFilterTitle: "Filter large queues",
    tourCrewFilterBody: "Search by game or host, set minimum seats and filter by requirements. Filters affect games; suitable rooms are highlighted as well.",
