    tourCrewFloorPlanEditorTitle: "Draw the venue map",
    tourCrewFloorPlanEditorBody: "Place and duplicate selected rooms, free forms, text, symbols and small graphics directly. Add, rename and arrange floors in the required order. The collapsible object list selects elements and changes their stacking order. Free rooms remain semantic rooms; lines, rectangles and circles are independent drawing shapes for walls and wayfinding. Enter an exact rotation for any object or hold Shift to snap in 15° steps. Room labels support fixed line breaks and optional hyphenation points. Zoom, hand tool, grid and optional alignment help you draw, while tracing references remain local. Preview, print, versions, import, export and copy support reuse and recovery.",
